; The variable: a glyph that Godot fails to triangulate. At embolden 1.2 the a fails, so the deep text
; on the left shows only its sides and the flat text on the right shows nothing of it, while the 8 and
; the A keep their faces. The scene is that of unit-text-mesh-embolden.tscn otherwise.

